One of the most fascinating connections between the RH and quantum mechanics comes from the idea of "quantum chaos." The energy levels of certain quantum systems, especially those that exhibit chaotic classical dynamics, show statistical properties similar to the distribution of the zeros of the Riemann zeta function.

